== Usage ==
A simple highlighted section for a district or area article.

<pre>
{{Area info section
 | title = Overview
 | text = A short, sourced description of the area.
}}
</pre>

Parameters:
* `title` — optional heading; defaults to “Area information”.
* `text` — the content displayed in the section.

Copy this source into `Template:Area info section` on the target wiki and test it in a sandbox.
